{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42802","headline":"木芙蓉 · 刘兼","name":"木芙蓉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素灵失律诈风流，强把芳菲半载偷。\n是叶葳蕤霜照夜，此花烂熳火烧秋。\n谢莲色淡争堪种，陶菊香穠亦合羞。\n谁道金风能肃物，因何厚薄不相侔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}